/* The money box the story opens over its talk (script_common.c: createShopBitsBox, renderShopBitsBox). One pixel of
   the original is 3dp; the 320 x 240 screen is a 960 x 720dp frame centred on a wide screen. The same box as the shop's
   (rect -0x98, -0x62, 0x52 x 0x21 from the centre), measured on the original with the shop forced in room02: x 8 to
   90 and y 22 to 55, the word from x 30 and the money right-aligned to end at x 67. The skins give the look; this is the layout and
   a plain look for any skin. */

body {
	width: 100%;
	height: 100%;
	pointer-events: none;
}

#frame {
	position: absolute;
	left: 50%;
	top: 0;
	width: 960dp;
	height: 720dp;
	margin-left: -480dp;
}

#bits-box {
	position: absolute;
	text-align: left;
	left: 24dp;
	top: 66dp;
	width: 246dp;
	height: 99dp;
	padding: 6dp 0 0 63dp;
	box-sizing: border-box;
	border: 3dp #d0d0d0;
	background-color: #000000c0;
	font-size: 33dp;
	line-height: 39dp;
}

.bits-row {
	display: block;
	height: 39dp;
	white-space: pre;
}

#bits-value {
	width: 111dp;
	text-align: right;
}
